<section class="sec" id="platform">
<div class="hd2">
<div><div class="eyeb">The platform</div><h2>One layer over the portals your team already logs into.</h2></div>
<p class="sub">Bix does not replace your billing partner. It plugs the leak at the claims layer — where denials actually live — and gives finance, RCM and coding a single working source of truth.</p>
</div>
<div class="trio">
<article class="card gl">
<div class="tg">Surface</div>
<h3>Root-cause denial patterns, sliced four ways.</h3>
<p>Stop hunting across four spreadsheets to find which payer, code, clinician or facility is leaking the most money this week.</p>
<div class="mini">
<div class="rk"><span class="i num">01</span><span class="n">Daman — Thiqa</span><span class="p">38.4%</span></div>
<div class="rk"><span class="bar"><i style="width:96%"></i></span></div>
<div class="rk"><span class="i num">02</span><span class="n">ADNIC — Enhanced</span><span class="p">24.1%</span></div>
<div class="rk"><span class="bar"><i style="width:60%"></i></span></div>
<div class="rk"><span class="i num">03</span><span class="n">Oman Insurance</span><span class="p">14.2%</span></div>
<div class="rk"><span class="bar"><i style="width:36%"></i></span></div>
</div>
</article>
<article class="card gl">
<div class="tg">Reconcile</div>
<h3>Every claim paired with its remittance — automatically.</h3>
<p>Daily auto-sync replaces the manual &ldquo;log into DHA, log into RHA, compare two CSV exports&rdquo; morning ritual.</p>
<div class="stat"><b class="num">06:00</b><span>GST daily auto-sync across all six mandatory portals.</span><em>Matched, not guessed</em></div>
</article>
<article class="card gl">
<div class="tg">Recover</div>
<h3>Resubmissions tracked with owner, SLA and reason.</h3>
<p>A rejected claim becomes a work item with a clock, not another unmarked folder in the shared drive.</p>
<div class="stat"><b class="num">+18%</b><span>Denial-recovery uplift on average across live facilities.</span><em>90-day rolling</em></div>
</article>
</div>
</section>

