<div class="cside">
<div class="cbox gl" id="privacy">
<h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>Privacy &amp; data handling</h4>
<p>PHI stays inside the UAE unless a cross-border rule (NPHIES, eClaimLink) sends it there itself. Access is per-facility and per-role; every resubmission action is logged with actor, timestamp and reason.</p>
